      <activity id="95d40899-29fb-5f8e-bb9f-9578fe80e24a" activityNameId="722f1835-ee5f-5fd6-b8b2-1c3ecc5ea154" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, hydropower, at run-of-river power plant without reservoir</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, hydropower, at run-of-river power plant without reservoir
Efficiency: 0.82. The data set describes a mix and is therefore not representative for individual plants. This dataset is recalculated based on Frischknecht et al. (1996) and Bauer (2007), complemented with data from Vattenfall (2008) and Axpo (2008);
UUID: 7057ceb6-10bc-3ca2-9f03-8a85629ea0d5
Operation of average of run-of-river power stations without reservoir. It includes the land area transformed and occupied, lubricant oil consumption, spill and disposal, turbined water.
Location: Average electricity production of Swiss run-of-river hydropower plants.
Technology: Mix of run-of-river hydropower plants built between 1945 and 1980, representative for Switzerland. Efficiency: 0.82.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7057ceb6-10bc-3ca2-9f03-8a85629ea0d5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
